updated note (flagged by story, design, build, and review this round) \u2014 every stage is correctly following CLAUDE.md's \"confirm before overwriting\" policy; that's the pipeline working as designed, not a defect to prompt away.\n\n**Needs a human:** please grant the pending `Edit` permission for `/home/dev/projects/ai-dev-switchboard/agents/tester.md` (or tell me another way to apply it) so I can land the fallback-on-denial instruction above into `tester.md`.", "meta": {"native_type": "assistant", "block_type": "text", "session_id": "1966a27b-a316-4c06-9e9f-d851bcfae3f0"}}
